Defenders of Erenor look to Ollo, the son of a dwarven king whose land was conquered in battle. A greedy seeker obsessed with time manipulation, he would later become Shatigon, the god of gold and abundance.

'''Defense''' is the tank [[Skill Trees|skill tree]]. It builds Mettle from the damage you take and spends it on healing and on aggro, and it keeps enemies on you with taunts, stuns and a silence. It deals little damage of its own, so it is usually paired with trees that bring damage and utility or further crowd control.

